{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47206","headline":"赋得闻晓莺啼 · 惟审","name":"赋得闻晓莺啼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卷帘清梦後，芳树引流莺。\n隔叶传春意，穿花送晓声。\n未调云路翼，空负桂枝情。\n莫尽关关兴，羇愁正厌生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"惟审","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}